      "<div class=\"cms-faq cms-faq-style-list\"><details class=\"cms-faq-item\" name=\"cms-faq-fitness-timetable-2\"><summary class=\"cms-faq-q\">I have never lifted anything. Is that a problem?</summary><div class=\"cms-faq-a\">It is the normal starting point here. Beginners classes exist for exactly this and nobody in them has been training long.</div></details><details class=\"cms-faq-item\" name=\"cms-faq-fitness-timetable-2\"><summary class=\"cms-faq-q\">Do I need to book?</summary><div class=\"cms-faq-a\">For classes yes, because of the cap of eight. Open gym you can just turn up.</div></details><details class=\"cms-faq-item\" name=\"cms-faq-fitness-timetable-2\"><summary class=\"cms-faq-q\">What if I have an injury?</summary><div class=\"cms-faq-a\">Tell us in the first session. Most things can be trained around, and we would rather work with it than find out about it in week three.</div></details></div>",
